@VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297

### Comprar una entrada (suelta)
POST {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "ticketTypeId": "{{ticketTypeId}}",
  "zoneId": "{{zoneId}}",
  "holder": "Ada Lovelace",
  "price": 58.50
}

### Pagar una entrada (Bizum fuerza compensación en la demo)
POST {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Card"
}

### Estado de una entrada (incluye cuenta atrás de reserva)
GET {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Accept: application/json

### Entradas de un comprador
GET {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?holder=Ada Lovelace
Accept: application/json

### Check-in físico en puerta
POST {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/check-in

### Ingresos de un evento
GET {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/events/{{eventId}}/revenue
Accept: application/json

### Pedido multi-entrada atómico (ADR 0028)
POST {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "holder": "Ada Lovelace",
  "lines": [
    { "ticketTypeId": "{{ticketTypeId}}", "zoneId": "{{zoneId}}", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 58.50 }
  ]
}

### Pagar un pedido completo
POST {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Card"
}

### Estado de un pedido
GET {{VenuePulse.CheckIn.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Accept: application/json

###
